## What Graphiti is

[Graphiti](https://github.com/getzep/graphiti) is an Apache-2.0 framework for temporal knowledge graphs, maintained by the Zep team. It ingests episodes, the raw stream as it arrived, and derives entity nodes and relationship edges from them. Each fact carries a validity window: when it became true, and when it was superseded. A superseded fact is invalidated rather than deleted, so the history stays answerable.

