Graphiti is the engine, and it is the part you can read, fork and run. Zep is the managed service from the same team, built on it. If you are comparing one managed service against another, the page you want is [past.dev vs Zep](/vs/zep). If you are deciding whether to operate the engine yourself, stay here.

