past.dev accepts raw text and its original timestamp without a required schema, and the timestamp can be backdated so an import does not land as today. The same public routes are available through the managed service and the self-host bundle.

`/recall` returns ranked documents with occurrence dates and source excerpts under a token budget. The application decides whether those documents establish an answer.

