### Does this add past.dev to every Lovable workspace?

No. A custom connector belongs to one workspace. Other workspaces can create their own connector with the same fields and knowledge.

### Does an identity make an ingested note private?

No. The identity identifies the author. The audience controls access. A note without an audience is visible to all identities in the project.

### Do I need a public SKILL.md file?

The skill is optional. Import the public past.dev skill to reuse the implementation and test procedure across Lovable projects. Keep the API knowledge in the connector definition.

